OL,3,GNEWSADad fined after son, 2, died in
OL,4,ACyprus hotel fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father whose two-year-old boy fell
OL,7,Ffrom a fourth floor window at a hotel
OL,8,Fin Cyprus has been fined bB,3,000
OL,9,F(#2,500) for causing his death.
OL,11,FJoshua Foster thought the window was
OL,12,Fclosed when he placed his son on a sill
OL,13,Fto show him the view of a waterpark and
OL,14,F"lost control" of him, Paphos District
OL,15,FCourt previously heard.
OL,17,FThe toddler fell nearly 40ft (12.1m) at
OL,18,Fthe five-star King Evelthon Beach Hotel
OL,19,Fand Resort on 12 July, the first day of
OL,20,Fthe family's holiday in Chlorakas.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
